  <!-- ============================================================
       地下設施用的 NPC 守墓人：固定頭部、固定武裝的三種編制。玩家培育不到。
       ⚠ 培育時取的是「同種族在 DefDatabase 裡的第一個 PawnKind」（Bill_ProductionMech.CreateProducts），
       所以這三個 NPC 編制必須留在玩家用的 DMS_Mech_Gravekeeper / DMS_Mech_Gravekeeper_Stugna 之後，
       否則培育出來的會變成 NPC 編制。
       不設 alternateGraphicChance：沒有 alternateGraphics 清單時機率必須是 0，否則 TryGetAlternate 會對 null 取樣。
         掘墓人 Sepulturero：圓頭（D），靠掃擊拳與駭蜥大跳近戰
         送葬者 Enterrador：方頭（B，帶發射架），GAU-19 與斯圖格納導彈的反裝甲編制
         守夜人 Velador：三角頭（F），栓動炮與狙擊手的精確射擊

       NPC gravekeepers for the underground installations: three fixed-head, fixed-loadout configurations the player cannot gestate.
       ⚠ Gestation takes the race's first PawnKind in the DefDatabase (Bill_ProductionMech.CreateProducts), so these three
       must stay after the player kinds DMS_Mech_Gravekeeper / DMS_Mech_Gravekeeper_Stugna, or gestation would produce them.
       No alternateGraphicChance: without an alternateGraphics list the chance must stay 0, or TryGetAlternate samples a null list.
         Sepulturero: round head (D), closes in with the sweeping fists and the Tarbosaurus heavy jump
         Enterrador: square head (B, with the rack), anti-armour configuration with a GAU-19 and Stugna missiles
         Velador: triangle head (F), bolt cannon and the sniper's precision marksmanship

       武器池：三種編制都會從龍騎兵武器（步槍、榴彈槍，加上 MobileDragoon 的霰彈槍）中抽一把；
       送葬者與守夜人另外可以抽到各自的招牌武器。原版依 generateCommonality 加權抽選，
       所以招牌武器大約佔 1/4（沒有 MobileDragoon 時 1/3）。weaponMoney 定在 9999，池裡每一把都買得起。
       DMS_Dragoon_SG 只是字串，沒有 MobileDragoon 時不會比對到任何武器，不會報錯。
       Weapon pool: all three draw from the dragoon weapons (rifle, grenade launcher and, with MobileDragoon, the shotgun);
       the Enterrador and Velador can also draw their signature weapon. Vanilla weights the draw by generateCommonality,
       so the signature weapon comes up about 1 in 4 (1 in 3 without MobileDragoon). weaponMoney is pinned at 9999 so every
       weapon in the pool is affordable. DMS_Dragoon_SG is a plain tag string; without MobileDragoon it matches nothing.
       ============================================================ -->

